data: {"id": "cf0d9ec9d5fa41e3-thinking-parallel_evidence-204", "run_id": "cf0d9ec9d5fa41e3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "需要先修正之前 execute_pod_promql 调用缺失 namespace 的问题，然后并行执行所有首轮采集。\n\n**首轮补证 & 并行采集计划：**\n1. `execute_pod_promql` (修正后): 获取 phase/restarts/last_terminated_reason 基线。\n2. `kubectl_describe`: 获取 Pod 当前状态、Restart Count、Last State Reason。\n3. `kubectl_events`: 获取近期事件。\n4. `query_pod_logs` (带关键词): 针对日志中发现的 \"memory allocation advanced\"，搜索 OOM/Memory 相关错误。\n5. `execute_pod_promql`: 获取内存 limit 和 working set 趋势。\n\n开始并行执行：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788801352279, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

